###

# Replace `< ./resume.pdf` below with a path to an actual PDF file - no sample
# is checked into the repo. Path is relative to this .http file (tests/).
#
# timeout sets the IDE HTTP Client's own response-read timeout, not
# anything server-side: Docling's PDF->Doctags conversion plus two
# sequential real Anthropic calls (Stage 2 classify, Stage 4 correct) can
# take 60-90+ seconds end to end, well past the client's ~60s default -
# the request can still succeed server-side after the client alone times out.

# @timeout 3 m
POST http://localhost:8000/extract_candidate_occupations
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cvTest1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./cvTest1.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

###

